# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Section 1 - baseline security headers for every page.
# Section 2 - cache lifetimes for static assets (versioned-ish, never for HTML
#              or the /api/* endpoints).
# Section 3 - a Content-Security-Policy in REPORT-ONLY mode.
#
# The CSP is report-only on purpose. The site ships a large amount of inline
# <script> and inline <style>, plus several hundred inline event handlers
# (onclick=...) across 265 pages, so an enforced policy would need either
# 'unsafe-inline' anyway or a nonce/hash refactor of every page. Running it in
# report-only mode means the policy is live and observable through the
# Cloudflare CSP reports dashboard (Security > CSP) without any risk of
# breaking a tool, a form or an ad slot.
# See the "Security" section of README.md for the full inventory and the exact
# steps required to flip it to enforcing mode.
#
# Unused cdnjs / jsdelivr sources and the old script.google.com source were
# removed after an inventory confirmed no public page loads them. Feedback now
# posts to the same-origin /api/feedback function, and Turnstile's
# challenges.cloudflare.com origin is retained/added to script-src, frame-src,
# connect-src and img-src. No wildcard sources were introduced.
#
# AdSense origins: the site serves AdSense (ca-pub-3298442828407277) on every
# page, so its runtime requests were measured in a real browser and the exact
# origins that produced report-only violations were added below:
#   script-src  pagead2.googlesyndication.com (adsbygoogle.js + show_ads_impl)
#               ep2.adtrafficquality.google (sodar2.js)
#   frame-src   googleads.g.doubleclick.net (ad frame)
#               pagead2.googlesyndication.com (AdSense frames)
#               ep2.adtrafficquality.google (sodar frames)
#               www.google.com - scoped to /recaptcha/ (the AdSense aframe is
#               https://www.google.com/recaptcha/api2/aframe), not the whole host
#   connect-src ep1.adtrafficquality.google (sodar getconfig)
#   img-src     ep1.adtrafficquality.google (sodar pixel)
# No wildcard sources were added. Unused sources were removed only after the
# public-file inventory confirmed they are not loaded by any page.
#
# HSTS: the header below is aligned with the policy the zone actually serves
# (max-age=15552000, 180 days). The Cloudflare zone-level HSTS setting is the
# source of truth for this header and can override the repository value, so the
# repo was previously declaring 2 years (63072000) while production sent 180
# days - a real, observable drift. 180 days is the conservative, already-live
# value; raising it is a deliberate zone-level decision, not a repo edit.
#
# includeSubDomains is set after the final hardening subdomain inventory
# confirmed that the two web hostnames are HTTPS-only and no HTTP-only web
# service under the zone was found. `preload` remains intentionally OFF: it is
# difficult to reverse and was not requested or submitted to hstspreload.org.
# Keep the zone-level HSTS setting in sync with this value.
#
# Trusted Types is NOT enabled: the site has hundreds of inline onclick handlers
# and innerHTML writes, so `require-trusted-types-for 'script'` would break
# tools. It would need a refactor first. `unsafe-inline` is retained only because
# that existing application design requires it; no broad remote source or
# `unsafe-eval` was added.
#
# The CSP below is enforced after the final compatibility review of the
# homepage, representative tool pages, guides, search, feedback form, Turnstile
# and measured AdSense origins. `upgrade-insecure-requests` is safe now that the
# policy is enforced and the site is HTTPS-only. Roll back by restoring the
# previous report-only block; do not add wildcard sources to silence failures.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=(), midi=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://easyworktools.online
  Vary: Origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://i.ytimg.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob:; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google https://www.google.com/recaptcha/; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/apple-touch-icon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/ads.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

/robots.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/sitemap.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  Content-Type: application/xml; charset=utf-8

/llms.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# Internal audit/remediation material is answered 404 by functions/reports/*.
# These headers keep any accidental static fallback out of search indexes.
/reports
  Cache-Control: no-store
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/reports/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/ai-catalog.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

/security.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400


# Shared assets default. This broad rule MUST come before the narrower asset
# rules below: `_headers` detaches only remove values added by earlier rules, so
# each narrower block detaches this Cache-Control and sets its own single value.
# Without the detach, matching paths get two conflicting Cache-Control values.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# The feedback client and its public config change with the proxy deployment.
# Revalidate on every load so a redeploy cannot leave returning visitors on a
# stale direct-post client. The homepage also uses a version query to bypass
# any existing edge/browser cache immediately.
/assets/feedback-config.js
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/feedback-form.js
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Webfonts: same-origin, never change without a redeploy, and the whole point of
# self-hosting them was to get them under this policy instead of Google's.
# 30 days + stale-while-revalidate (not `immutable`: the filenames are not
# content-hashed, so a font update must be able to reach returning visitors).
/assets/fonts/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800

# Icons and the social preview card change only when the branding does.
/assets/favicon*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/assets/apple-touch-icon.png
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/assets/og-image.png
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/assets/easyworktools-og.png
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/assets/img/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# Vendored third-party libraries and the lazy loader that fetches them. They
# change only when a pinned upstream version is replaced, so they get the same
# 30-day lifetime as the fonts rather than the 7-day shared-asset default.
/assets/vendor/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=604800

# Generated indexes: short cache so a new tool or post shows up quickly.
/tools-manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
/blog-manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# Per-user traffic counts and page-view writes must never be cached.
/api/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://easyworktools.online
  Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS
  Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type
  Vary: Origin
